- @title = 'Agencies · Nitrous'
- @html_class = 'light'
- @body_id = 'agencies'
- @body_class = 'story'


.page
  .page-hero
    .container
      = render partial: 'layouts/webnav', locals: { active: 'education' }
      .hero-copy
        h2
          | Nitrous and Agencies
        h3
          | Lightning-fast development in the cloud: spin up and maintain
          br
          | multiple projects with different clients effortlessly

        a.btn.white href="/app/#/signup" Sign Up To Nitrous

  .notice.darker
    .container
      p
        a href="/orgs" target='_blank'
          | Need additional security, control, and support?
          span.link Try Nitrous Orgs
          i.fa.fa-chevron-right

  article.featurette.full-window.with-border
    .container
      h3.big-title All your teams's projects, in one place
      h4
        | Nitrous lets you and your team create, administer, share, and
        br
        | snapshot development projects from one convenient place

      .full-visual
        .window-controls.osx-safari
          span
          span
          span
          .nav-btn
          .nav-btn
          .url-address
          .nav-new-tab

        = image_tag 'home/dashboard-next-agencies.png', width:"970", height:"524"


  article.featurette.with-pulled-visual.cut-off.with-border
    .container
      .box-wrapper.text-on-left

        .box.auto.text
          .content
            h3.big-title Snapshots
            p
              | Preserve the state of your project's environment, and revert back to them at any time

        .box.auto
          .content
            .full-visual.window.centered
              .window-controls.osx.colored
                span
                span
                span
              = image_tag 'home/snapshots-next-agencies.png', width:"970", height:"524", alt: 'Nitrous Org member Administration'

  article.featurette.with-pulled-visual.cut-off.with-border
    .container
      .box-wrapper.text-on-left

        .box.auto.text
          .content
            h3.big-title Org member Administration
            p
              | Quickly add and remove team members, and set their role within the team.

        .box.auto
          .content
            .full-visual.window.centered
              .window-controls.osx.colored
                span
                span
                span
              = image_tag 'home/members-next-agencies.png', width:"970", height:"524", alt: 'Nitrous Org member Administration'

  article.colored.rails.quote
    .container

      blockquote
        = image_tag 'home/quote-klabnik-logo.png', class: 'visual', alt: 'Steve Klabnik'

        p
          | I know how to administer a computer well enough.&nbsp;
          strong But I don't want to
          | . Nitrous.IO allows me to just say "I want to code some Rails now, kthx" and not have to worry about getting all the details straight. Sometimes, I care about the details, but most of the time, I don't.
        cite
          | Steve Klabnik
          span , Rails Core Committer & prolific Open Source contributor


  article.colored.wilsonsmith.quote
    .container

      blockquote
        = image_tag 'home/quote-wilsonsmith-logo.svg', class: 'visual', alt: 'Wilson & Smith'
        p
          | I love the vision. It has been prophesied by the forefathers of UNIX that a day would come in which our computers would simply be a piece of glass connected to some computer on the network.&nbsp;
          strong Nitrous.io is making that dream a reality
          |. Practically speaking, the feature that captivates my attention is that I have&nbsp;
          strong easy SSH access to a Linux machine
          |  that someone else is maintaining. Among all of my responsibilities, personal system administration is something that I am keen on delegating. If I never have to worry about keeping a machine online and its state secured, then I will be winning.
        cite
          | Ryan Smith
          span , Consultant at Wilson & Smith



  = render 'layouts/cta'

= render partial: 'layouts/footer', locals: { active: 'agencies' }
